category: Libs
build-depends: cygport libboost-devel libssl-devel
sdesc: "Cross platform C++ library for MIME format and SMTP, POP3 and IMAP protocols (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "mailio is a cross platform C++ library for MIME format and SMTP, POP3 and IMAP
protocols. It is based on the standard C++ 17 and Boost library."
